Node ID=01 
Text=It is good to meet you, small one. I must admit that I doubted Menoetius when he told me that an oracle said we should wait here for the improbable arrival of...well, of you. I thought he'd been dipping into the mercury again.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Who are you?
