Reply Text=What have you been doing to the humans you've captured? 
Go to node ID=05 Doing nothing to the humans
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=02 Go talk to Lethos
Text=I am quite surprised to see you, fleshling. Perhaps we can talk later, but I am busy at the moment starting this fire. You should speak with Lethos, he can be found southwest of here. 
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=04 Iapetus' job
Text=My name is Iapetus. As an elder, I help to lead the tribe. Right now, I'm in charge of keeping the humans we captured safe and secure. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=And how does eating them make them either safe or secure? 
Go to node ID=10 Titans don't eat people

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=You've already destroyed their town, why are you now trying to keep them "safe"? 
Go to node ID=04 Keep the humans safe
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=04 Keep the humans safe
Text=As long as they are in our custody, we are responsible for their welfare. Where possible, we should do our best to ensure their survival. But if you wish to discuss ethics, you'd best talk to Rhea.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Where is Rhea? 
Go to node ID=04 Where is Rhea

Requirement=!None
