Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Nevermind, but if you're so concerned with their welfare, why are you eating them? 
Go to node ID=10 Titans don't eat people
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=04 Already spoken to Rhea
Text=She's quite talkative isn't she? Well, then, what can I help you with?
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
