Node ID=04 Where is Rhea
Text=She's can usually be found on the south side of this settlement tutoring Ephebos. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I will speak to her later. First, I must ask you to stop eating your prisoners.
Go to node ID=10 Titans don't eat people

