------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=05 Doing nothing to the humans
Text=Nothing untoward. The humans doubtless dislike the treatment they've received from us, but then I'm sure the flocks they keep feel the same way.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I've been told you're *eating* them, 
Go to node ID=10 Titans don't eat people
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=10 Titans don't eat people
Text=Neither ourselves nor our ogres have been eating anybody, small one, but I am afraid you are right in thinking that something has.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What do you mean? 
Go to node ID=15 Explanation
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=15 Explanation
Text=I will explain. When Menoetius told us that we would be staying in this village for a time, we initially took hostage the youth of this town. I know this sounds harsh to you, but it was the only way to ensure the townspeople wouldn't seek to flee and raise an army against us.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What did you do with the adults? 
Go to node ID=20 Adults are free range

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Speaking of fleeing, I must be going. Farewell.
Go to node ID=100 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=20 Adults are free range
Text=We felt secure enough with the children under guard to let the humans police themselves and allowed them free movement within the village.  All was well until a week ago when we discovered a pair of them dead on the outskirts of town. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What happened next? 
Go to node ID=25 More deaths
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=25 More deaths
Text=We said nothing to the humans lest we panic them and thought that perhaps the pair had merely fallen victim to some sort of wild animal, but the deaths did not stop there. A couple days later we found another body. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What have you done to prevent further deaths?
Go to node ID=30 Humans caged
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 Humans caged
Text=We decided that the best course of action would be to put all of the humans in a single, enclosed area. No building in town was large or intact enough to hold the entire population, so we have caged them under the open sky. While they may not find this comfortable, they are at least better protected from the creature that stalks them. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Have you told your prisoners about the creature?
Go to node ID=35 Humans not informed

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I must be going. Goodbye. 
Go to node ID=100 Goodbye
Icon=Exit Icon
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=35 Humans not informed
Text=No, we have not told the humans of the predator that stalks their village. It would serve only to frighten them further, spurring them to attempt escape. 
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Your prisoners think you've begun feeding on them. 
Go to node ID=40 Humans confused

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I want to talk to the prisoners. 
