Node ID=50 The facelessness of the beast
Text=The creature is no mere bear, as we at first thought. It is, I fear, a Daeva or one of their ilk. We've managed to track it down twice, both times in or around this town. Unfortunately, it has thus far managed to elude us by changing forms and slipping away. It has even grown so bold as to strike at one of us.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=It has attacked a titan? 
