Node ID=60 It feeds off titan magic
Text=The nature of the attack on Mathuo has convinced me it is a Daeva. They are ancient enemies of our race, and while they rarely consume the stone of which we are made, they can feed off of our magical aura, our souls. They are a terrifying foe.
