Node ID=61 your spirit
Text=<Iapetus looks at the air a little behind your shoulder.> You carry one, and you carry it openly. Yes, small one. It would take that from you and leave the rest of you standing empty in the road. Your kind bound spirits and called it mastery; to a Daeva it is a larder with the door left open. If you hunt this thing, understand that you are also the bait.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Then it will come to me, and I will be ready.
