Node ID=66 tracks
Text=We looked, and we trampled what we were looking at; there were nine of us in that cul-de-sac on the southeast edge of town and not one of us thought to stand still. But there was spoor by the rocks where Mathuo was taken that belonged to nothing that walks here. Perhaps a beast-man's nose is worth something after all.
Should Have Voiceover=0

